# StegaCrypt — Environment Variables
#
# All processing in StegaCrypt runs entirely client-side (Canvas API + JavaScript).
# No backend, no API keys, and no secrets are required to run this application.
#
# This file exists as a standard practice template for contributors.
# Copy this to .env and fill in any values if you extend the app with a backend.

# Example: Analytics (optional, add your own if needed)
# VITE_GA_TRACKING_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# Example: Deployment URL (used for og:url meta tags)
# VITE_PUBLIC_URL=https://stegacrypt.vercel.app
